00:11:59,199 --> 00:12:01,888
It is limited to thirty-six units,

302
00:12:01,888 --> 00:12:05,051
twenty-four coupés and twelve roadsters.

303
00:12:05,231 --> 00:12:06,628
By our arithmetic,

304
00:12:06,628 --> 00:12:09,267
that is one and a half Revolutions

