333
00:13:11,939 --> 00:13:15,028
It ends: just how fast is anyone's

334
00:13:15,028 --> 00:13:15,573
guess.

335
00:13:15,922 --> 00:13:17,037
What has been shown?

336
00:13:17,217 --> 00:13:20,411
Motor One, in a twenty twenty-two article,

337
00:13:20,411 --> 00:13:23,225
says the Venom F5 reached two hundred

338
00:13:23,225 --> 00:13:26,192
seventy-one point six miles per hour at

339
00:13:26,192 --> 00:13:29,158
the Kennedy Space Center in February of

340
00:13:29,158 --> 00:13:29,918
that year.

341
00:13:30,098 --> 00:13:32,943
Wikipedia lists a half mile in fourteen

342
00:13:32,943 --> 00:13:35,716
point four four seconds at two hundred

343
00:13:35,716 --> 00:13:37,466
nineteen miles per hour,

344
00:13:37,466 --> 00:13:39,217
a production car record,

345
00:13:39,217 --> 00:13:42,208
driven by John Hennessey on the thirtieth

346
00:13:42,208 --> 00:13:44,251
