00:13:53,494 --> 00:13:56,681
two hundred twenty-one point nine two miles

351
00:13:56,681 --> 00:13:57,348
per hour.

352
00:13:57,528 --> 00:13:59,783
So two sources list a half mile

353
00:13:59,783 --> 00:14:02,474
