354
00:14:02,474 --> 00:14:03,856
hundred twenty-two.

355
00:14:04,036 --> 00:14:05,649
They may be different runs.

356
00:14:05,829 --> 00:14:07,151
By our arithmetic,

357
00:14:07,151 --> 00:14:10,235
the time difference is seven hundredths of

358
00:14:10,235 --> 00:14:12,952
