374
00:14:46,701 --> 00:14:47,827
Then the crash.

375
00:14:48,007 --> 00:14:50,597
The Drive reports that during a zero

376
00:14:50,597 --> 00:14:53,043
to two hundred fifty mile per hour

377
00:14:53,043 --> 00:14:55,202
