00:17:35,481 --> 00:17:37,753
The design changed on the way to

447
00:17:37,753 --> 00:17:38,534
production.

448
00:17:38,714 --> 00:17:42,254
Wikipedia says an exterior mock-up shown at

449
00:17:42,254 --> 00:17:44,723
