485
00:19:01,823 --> 00:19:04,985
A note on the Revolution's downforce figures,

486
00:19:04,985 --> 00:19:06,741
as reported by The Drive:

487
00:19:06,741 --> 00:19:09,340
more than eight hundred pounds at one

488
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:11,729
hundred eighty-six miles per hour,

489
00:19:11,729 --> 00:19:14,328
