499
00:19:32,596 --> 00:19:34,001
The two figures agree.

500
00:19:34,350 --> 00:19:36,707
Speeds in kilometres per hour,

501
00:19:36,707 --> 00:19:39,691
for viewers outside the United States.

502
00:19:39,871 --> 00:19:42,885
Wikipedia gives the Venom GT's two hundred

503
00:19:42,885 --> 00:19:45,613
seventy point four nine miles per hour

504
00:19:45,613 --> 00:19:48,699
as four hundred thirty-five point three one

505
00:19:48,699 --> 00:19:50,134
kilometres per hour.

506
00:19:50,314 --> 00:19:52,979
Motor One gives the F5's two hundred

507
00:19:52,979 --> 00:19:56,679
